cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite both the paper and this repository."
title: "phases: analysis code and data for \"What Are Phases? Geographic Structure, Neutral Copying, and the Search for Social Boundaries in the Lower Mississippi Valley\""
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and data for a study of the late pre-contact phases of the
  St. Francis basin, Lower Mississippi Valley: whether decorated-ceramic
  assemblages record geographic structure, neutral copying, or bounded social
  units. Includes the decorated-class matrix and its provenance, the neutral
  copying model, the spatial field, latent-unit and barrier Stan models, the
  findings files every reported number traces to, and the manuscript figures.
